  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      280.77,
      399.62,
      305.11
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      319.77,
      399.6,
      344.11
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Foreign Loans (Repeal) Act, No. of 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      358.77,
      399.58,
      383.11
    ],
    "text": "2. The Foreign Loans Act, No. 29 of 1957 is hereby repealed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      397.77,
      399.59,
      435.11
    ],
    "text": "3. Notwithstanding the repeal of the Foreign Loans Act, No. 29 of 1957 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cForeign Loans Act\u201d) \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      449.77,
      399.61,
      604.11
    ],
    "text": "(a) every agreement relating to a foreign loan, a guarantee relating to a foreign loan and any contract, bond, promissory note or other document required by such agreement or guarantee signed under section 2 of the Foreign Loans Act and in force on the day immediately preceding the date of commencement of this Act shall, in terms of section 38 of the Public Debt Management Act, No. 33 of 2024, be deemed, on and after the date of commencement of this Act, to have been validly signed under the Public Debt Management Act; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      618.77,
      399.61,
      669.11
    ],
    "text": "(b) every order made to give effect to an agreement or guarantee referred to in paragraph (a), prior to the date of commencement of this Act under section 4 of the Foreign Loans Act, and in force on the day",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
